    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Departments of Surgery of Aga Khan University have taken the concept of one university with multiple campuses to a new dimension by organizing the University's first combined surgical conference involving all the four surgical departments of the University including Nairobi, Dar-es-Salaam, Kabul and Karachi. This multinational academic event was held at Nairobi on August 1 and 2, 2014, and was jointly hosted by the Departments of Surgery at Nairobi and Karachi.",
